WEBVTT

00:15:28.196 --> 00:15:30.020
(Laughter)

00:15:30.044 --> 00:15:31.647
Is the goal achieved?

00:15:33.822 --> 00:15:34.976
Yes.

00:15:36.266 --> 00:15:39.000
Thirty million copies of this book.

00:15:40.519 --> 00:15:41.976
Al Gore, eat your heart out.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:45.657
(Laughter)

00:15:45.681 --> 00:15:49.302
Just exactly what Al is trying
to do, Rick is doing.

00:15:49.326 --> 00:15:52.267
This is a fantastic achievement.

00:15:53.028 --> 00:15:56.143
And the means -- how does he do it?

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:59.976
It's a brilliant redesign
of traditional religious themes --

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:03.301
updating them, quietly dropping
obsolete features,